---
import { titleCase } from "../../utils/title-case";
import PropertyGuide from '../../components/PropertyGuide.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import UndergroundExplorer from '../../components/UndergroundExplorer.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
import FaqSection from '../../components/FaqSection.astro';
import { areas, services, site } from '../../data/site';
import { faqSchema } from '../../data/faqs';
export function getStaticPaths(){return areas.map(area=>({params:{slug:area.slug},props:{area}}));}
const { area } = Astro.props;
const relevant = services.filter(s=>area.relevantServices.includes(s.slug));
const nearby = areas.filter(a=>area.neighbours.includes(a.slug));
const schema = [{ '@type':'Service',name:area.title,description:area.intro,serviceType:'Blocked drain diagnosis, clearing and repair',areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name:area.name+', NSW '+area.postcode,address:{'@type':'PostalAddress',addressLocality:area.name,postalCode:area.postcode,addressRegion:'NSW',addressCountry:'AU'}}},faqSchema(area.faqs)];
---
<BaseLayout title={area.title} description={area.description} schema={schema}>
<PageHero label={area.name} title={area.title} intro={area.intro} image={area.image} imageAlt={area.imageAlt}/>
<nav class="page-contents" aria-label="On this page">{area.slug === 'lavender-bay' && <a href="#lavender-booking">Before You Call</a>}<a href="#property-plan">Property Planning</a><a href="#evidence">Understanding the Findings</a><a href="#page-faq-title">Common Questions</a></nav>
{area.slug === 'lavender-bay' && <section class="section lavender-guide" id="lavender-booking" aria-labelledby="lavender-guide-title"><div><p class="lavender-guide__label">Lavender Bay drain help</p><h2 id="lavender-guide-title">Start with the affected drain.</h2><p>A pit filling during rain and wastewater rising from a low fixture suggest different investigations. Tell us when the water appears, whether it smells like sewage and whether more than one fixture is affected. <a href="/services/stormwater-drains/">Stormwater clearing</a> may suit a blocked line; a recurring fault may call for <a href="/services/cctv-drain-inspections/">camera inspection</a>. The cause needs assessment at the property.</p><p>If wastewater is overflowing, stop using connected fixtures and keep people and pets away. Stay clear of pits and water near electrical equipment.</p></div><div class="lavender-guide__booking"><h3>What to tell us when booking</h3><ul><li>The full address and the entrance we should use, especially if the drain is below street level.</li><li>Which fixture or pit backs up, when it happens and any previous clearing or camera findings.</li><li>Stairs, passage width, locked doors and the distance from unloading to the drain.</li><li>For a shared line, the building contact and who can authorise access or further work.</li></ul><p>We can discuss safe access, the next available response and whether a separate <a href="/services/drain-repairs/">repair assessment</a> is needed.</p><a class="call-button" href={site.phoneHref}><span>Call about your drain</span><strong>{site.phoneDisplay}</strong></a></div></section>}
{area.slug === 'naremburn' && <UndergroundExplorer />}
<section class:list={["section", area.slug !== 'naremburn' ? "detail-grid" : "slim-section"]}>
{area.slug !== 'naremburn' && <div><h2>What May Be Happening Underground</h2><p>{area.localIssue}</p><p>Tell us about rising toilet water, slow wastes, gurgling, overflowing gullies or pits holding water. One affected fixture may have a local restriction; several affected fixtures can point further along the connected line.</p></div>}
<div><h2>Plan Access before the Visit</h2><p>{area.access}</p><p>{area.localOrientation}</p><p>Current coverage is confirmed by full street address. Call with the symptoms and urgency to confirm the next available response.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section method-panel"><div><h2>Diagnosis before a Clearing Method</h2><p>{area.diagnosis}</p><p>Restoring flow and repairing a defect are separate tasks. Where damaged joints, poor fall or a failed section are found, the evidence and proposed repair scope are explained before agreement.</p></div><div><h2>Safe First Actions</h2><ul><li>Stop using fixtures connected to a backing-up line.</li><li>Keep people and pets away from wastewater.</li><li>Avoid chemical cleaners and tell the plumber about products already used.</li><li>Stay clear of water near electrical equipment, unstable ground and heavy pit covers.</li></ul><p>Urgent calls are taken 24 hours, 7 days a week. Do not enter a pit or confined space to investigate.</p></div></section>
<section class="section slim-section"><h2>Explore the Clearing and Repair Options</h2><div class="service-list">{relevant.map(service=><a class="service-row" href={'/services/'+service.slug+'/'}><h3>{titleCase(service.name)}</h3><p>{service.summary}</p><span>Read the method</span></a>)}</div><p>Unsure which fits? Explore the <a href="/services/">complete drain-service guide</a> or <a href="/contact/">describe the symptoms by phone</a>.</p></section>
<PropertyGuide area={area} relevant={relevant}/>
<FaqSection title={area.name+' drain questions'} items={area.faqs}/>
<section class="section nearby"><h2>Nearby Locality Guides</h2><p>Different streets and building types can need different access arrangements.</p><div class="area-links">{nearby.map(a=><a href={'/service-areas/'+a.slug+'/'}>{a.name}<span>NSW {a.postcode}</span></a>)}</div><a href="/service-areas/">All Lower North Shore service areas</a></section>
<CtaBand title={'Discuss your '+area.name+' drain'}/>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .lavender-guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem);align-items:start;border-block:1px solid #bfc7d1}
  .lavender-guide__label{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1954c5}
  .lavender-guide__booking{background:#f6f5f0;border-top:4px solid #071a35;padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem)}
  .lavender-guide__booking h3{margin-top:0}
  .lavender-guide__booking li{margin-bottom:.65rem}
  .lavender-guide__booking .call-button{margin-top:.25rem}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lavender-guide{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lavender-guide__booking .call-button{width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap;line-height:1.2}}
</style>
